    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328">

                <pb facs="0752" n="702" xml:id="pg702"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 181.9202/185: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Bandholtz to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-13">October 13, 1919</date>.<lb/>[Received October 16—1:08
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>147. From Bandholtz for Polk. Reference your No. 76.<anchor n="55"
                        xml:id="d328-f1"/> Roumanians have delivered 4,000 rifles and promised to
                    deliver 6,000 more today. If not delivered as promised will telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bandholtz</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
